Dear Master{{#if master_name}} {{master_name}}{{/if}}, good day!

We have been appointed{{#if charterer_name}} on behalf of Charterers {{charterer_name}}{{/if}} to attend your vessel on this forthcoming call at {{terminal_name}}. Welcome to this port. We are pleased to serve you and your crew during this call. Please keep us updated daily on your best ETA.

To facilitate pre-arrival notification and compliance with initial Port Authority formalities, please send us the following documents and information as soon as possible:

